Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person1:
	.string "Welcome! This facility is getting\n"
	.string "ready for challengers. Please come\l"
	.string "back soon!$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person2:
	.string "Welcome! This facility is getting\n"
	.string "ready for challengers. Please come\l"
	.string "back soon!$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person3:
	.string "The BATTLE HALL is all about one\n"
	.string "MOéMON. How far can it go?$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person4:
	.string "My PACHIRISU wants to try the HALL!\n"
	.string "It's small, but it's brave.$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person5:
	.string "I'm going to win every round with one\n"
	.string "MOéMON! Somehow!$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person6:
	.string "PACHIRISU: Chipa chipa!\p"
	.string "It looks ready for a challenge.$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person7:
	.string "I traveled all the way from SNOWPOINT\n"
	.string "to try the HALL!$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person8:
	.string "One MOéMON, many battles. That's a\n"
	.string "real test of trust.$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person9:
	.string "I've been coming to the HALL for\n"
	.string "years. My MOéMON is getting old, but\l"
	.string "it's still strong!$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person10:
	.string "I'm here to cheer on my friends! Go go!$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person11:
	.string "The BATTLE HALL's crowd is the\n"
	.string "loudest in SINNOH!$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person12:
	.string "My bug MOéMON will win the HALL! Bugs\n"
	.string "are underrated!$"

Sinnoh_BattleHall_Text_Person15:
	.string "I keep the records of the BATTLE\n"
	.string "HALL. Come back once challenges are\l"
	.string "open!$"

